cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite the associated article and this repository."
title: "Kinetic-informed machine learning for aptamer-induced modulation of drug release in PEGylated nanoliposomes"
abstract: >-
  Code and data for a proof-of-concept study combining classical release-kinetic
  modeling with machine learning to analyze and forecast in vitro drug release
  from aptamer-functionalized PEGylated nanoliposomes (Raloxifene, Naringin,
  Etoricoxib; aptamer = Yes/No). All reported machine-learning metrics are
  computed on the six real experimental profiles using leakage-free grouped
  cross-validation.
type: software
